    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2023-competency-10: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.41";
    dc:description "Existing comparative data can test some predicted associations. They cannot currently distinguish the proposed historical mechanism from several alternatives, so only parts are resolvable.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Across planarian lineages, quantify genomic disorder, developmental repair capacity, selection on structural versus regulatory loci, and morphology robustness, then compare predictions of runaway competency with alternative explanations. The hypothesis predicts stronger competency and weaker purifying selection on structural determinants together.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Available data do not track the proposed ratchet through time.", "Generic cellular competency has no agreed direct measure.", "Historical causation is confounded by asexuality, genome architecture, and population history.";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasConfidence> "0.72"^^xsd:double;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasEvidence> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/levin-2023-competency-10--gpt--dataset-1>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasScore> "0.406"^^xsd:double;
